The term-commitment discount on the upgraded rate of a ClearPath Managed IT Services agreement moving from ClearPath Essentials to ClearPath Standard counts the whole months from today to the agreement's term end date:
- 12 or more take 2.0 percent off;
- 6 up to 11 take 1.0 percent off;
- fewer take nothing off.

A whole month between two dates is counted only once the later date reaches the same day of the month as the earlier one, and a month window of N months ending today takes the entries dated fewer than N whole months before today.

**Hypothetical cases, term end 2026-06-30.** On 2025-06-30 there are 12 whole months left: 2.0 percent off. On 2025-07-01 there are 11: 1.0 percent off. On 2025-12-30 there are 6: 1.0 percent off. On 2026-01-05 there are 5: nothing.
